80px-Winter%27s_Breath_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hiemal Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Winter%27s_Breath_Icon.webp/40px-Winter%27s_Breath_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Winter%27s_Breath_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hiemal_Strike\" title=\"Hiemal Strike\">Hiemal Strike</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Pierce a creature with your frost-rimed trident and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chilled_(Condition)\" title=\"Chilled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Chill\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Chilled_(Condition)\" title=\"Chilled (Condition)\">Chill</a> it. </dd>\n</dl></div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Water_Myrmidon\" title=\"Water Myrmidon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Portrait_Water_Myrmidon.png/25px-Portrait_Water_Myrmidon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Portrait_Water_Myrmidon.png/38px-Portrait_Water_Myrmidon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Portrait_Water_Myrmidon.png/50px-Portrait_Water_Myrmidon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Water Myrmidons\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Portrait_Water_Myrmidon.png/25px-Portrait_Water_Myrmidon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8b/Portrait_Water_Myrmidon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Water_Myrmidon\" title=\"Water Myrmidon\">Water Myrmidons</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This is item cannot be obtained without exploits, because Water Myrmidons are <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Permanently_Armed\" title=\"Permanently Armed\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp/25px-Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp/38px-Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp/50px-Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Permanently Armed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp/25px-Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Permanently_Armed\" title=\"Permanently Armed\">Permanently Armed</a>.\n<ul><li>A previous exploit involving getting the myrmidon arrested has been patched out.</li></ul></li>\n<li>The version carried by NPC Myrmidons (as opposed to wildshape or player summons) is neither enchanted, nor deals elemental damage.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Hiemal Strike:</i></p>\n<ul><li>This weapon action has no recharge time or other limitations and is strictly better than the myrmidon's standard attack.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714194947\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.142 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.149 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4861/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 70617/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15260/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1603/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.052/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1584601/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  126.529      1 -total\n 79.41%  100.481      1 Template:WeaponPage\n 26.08%   32.994     54 Template:Trim\n 20.55%   26.005      1 Template:Inaccessible\n 20.21%   25.568      1 Template:Inaccessible/internal\n 19.64%   24.848      1 Template:Ambox\n 18.76%   23.735      9 Template:Uid\n 18.54%   23.456     12 Template:Icon_text\n 12.16%   15.389      3 Template:Damage_info\n 11.72%   14.823      7 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:22433-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714194947 and revision id 